Joven — third-party software bundled with the downloadable app
==============================================================

Joven itself is MIT-licensed; see LICENSE in the repository root.

The packaged app (Joven.exe / Joven.app / the Linux build) ships two external
tools so that a reader does not have to install them by hand. Both are
redistributed under permissive licences that require attribution, which is what
this file provides. Neither is modified in any way — each is the official release
artefact, downloaded at build time by packaging/fetch_vendor.py.

Installing Joven from PyPI (`pip install joven-ebook-annotator`) bundles neither;
this file applies only to the packaged app.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
kepubify — https://github.com/pgaskin/kepubify
Converts the finished EPUB into Kobo's KEPUB flavour.
Bundled at: vendor/kepubify (vendor/kepubify.exe on Windows)
