epubcheck — https://github.com/w3c/epubcheck
The reference EPUB validator, run as the external gate on Joven's output.
Bundled at: vendor/epubcheck/
Licence: BSD 3-Clause
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

epubcheck is redistributed as its official distribution directory, unmodified.
That directory carries its own licence files, and they ship with it rather than
being copied here, because epubcheck itself bundles thirty-seven third-party
libraries whose terms are recorded alongside:

    vendor/epubcheck/LICENSE.txt       the BSD 3-Clause licence and copyrights
    vendor/epubcheck/THIRD-PARTY.txt   the libraries epubcheck bundles
    vendor/epubcheck/licenses/         their licence texts

Copyright © 2007 Adobe Systems Incorporated
Copyright © 2008 IDPF
Copyright © 2017 W3C (MIT, ERCIM, Keio, Beihang)

epubcheck needs a Java runtime, which the app does not bundle. Where there is no
JVM, Joven reports the epubcheck check as SKIPPED and the other eleven integrity
checks still run.
